    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Irondrakes.</strong> This warrior of Dwarfen Mountain Holds enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“A grudge is not anger. It is memory given an edge.”<br><em>— Thorgrim Grudgebearer</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Battlefield Doctrine, Dwarf Axe, Great Weapon, Crossbow, Dwarfen Resilience, Dwarf Hand Weapon, Handgun, Shield Bash, Throwing Axe, Resilience, Whirlwind Sweep. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
